	"changelog": "\n2026.07.19: Full-featured release. Search, play, and download YouTube videos, playlists, and channels entirely by keyboard - audio playback with full transport control (play/pause, seek, volume, speed, previous/next with automatic continue), a sleep timer, personal playlist management, and a Subscriptions tab that browses a followed channel's Videos, Shorts, Live, and Playlists the way YouTube itself organizes them. Download to MP3 or MP4 with selectable quality, auto-sorted into folders by playlist or channel name. Full English/Thai interface with instant switching (Control+T).\n",
